## Conventions (short)

- Dates: DB guest fields often `MM-DD-YYYY`; UI/query often `YYYY-MM-DD`. TZ: **Asia/Manila**.
- Secrets: `supabase/.env.local` — never commit or log tokens/PII.
- Imports: UI `@/`; edge relative `../_shared/...`.
- Prod Supabase deploy: blocked unless user says **`kamewave`** (`.cursor/rules/no-prod-deploy.mdc`). Dual-track: **`main`** → legacy live; **`develop`** → `kame-homes` Preview + **`fwor…`** (mt-prod deferred until release).
- Dev/staging: **`docs/archive/operations/dev-staging-environment.md`** — `dev.kamehomes.space`, `./dev.sh --ui-only --env dev`, `bun run deploy:supabase:dev`.
- CI/CD: **`docs/workflow/in-progress/ci-cd-environments/`** · matrix **`ci-cd-environment-matrix.md`**.

